title trim page tags above the lines: OUT beyond the right edge (edge tag OUT 10:28.7, one row below the chip), the selected split 1 at 5:15.5 behind the IN edge tag, split 2 at 6:12.6 behind the OUT tag: no line strikes a tag; TRUE, then key F: FIT x8
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_QUIET 0.12
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_SPLITS 315500,372600
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_SELECTED 0

wait 600
shot tags-ob-true
expect text "ZOOM"
key f
wait 300
shot tags-ob-fit
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
